  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Season the beef with chili powder, chipotle powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Grill the beef for 5-7 minutes per side, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 135°F.",
    "Transfer the beef to a cutting board and let it rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Slice the beef against the grain into thin strips.",
    "Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Assemble the tacos by placing a few slices of beef onto a tortilla, followed by a sprinkle of cilantro and a squeeze of lime juice.",
